    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PRESENTS</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ShiNingCloud Studio</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an ARPG game developped by Unreal Engine 5.5 and features the  Sparring &amp; Suppression combat experience. In this game,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can  experience intense BOSS combats<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686170/extras/88b10c2043e67642fc12f25d26473069.poster.avif?t=1750956349\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686170/extras/88b10c2043e67642fc12f25d26473069.webm?t=1750956349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686170/extras/88b10c2043e67642fc12f25d26473069.mp4?t=1750956349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Also Hack&amp;Slash Minion wipes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686170/extras/1c7c67518f7604ed268f472e7481e4c7.poster.avif?t=1750956349\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686170/extras/1c7c67518f7604ed268f472e7481e4c7.webp?t=1750956349\" class=\"bb_img\" data-has-big width=800 height=340 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Unique Suppress-OVERTAKE system</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Gives you an unique interaction experience.(Similar to Sekiro's offset, but it's focused on attack instead of defense)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >An 3D Diablo-like Loot game behind the cool actions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Except super cool actions, this game also has a Diablo-like role development, loot system and 3 totally different\u00a0skill trees. Allocate your attributes, skill points FREELY and BUILD your own battle style! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 3 difficulties(Human, Asura, Celestial) in game. Higher the difficulty, better the drops! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conquer your enemy\u00a0and  LOOT your reward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Fully Upgraded with UE5 on &quot;Very Positive&quot; previous work</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Based on my first UE4 game &quot;Monkey King Simulator - Huaguo Mountain&quot;, this game has been fully rebuilt, polished and upgraded with Unreal Engine 5. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Action, Gameplay and End-game content  have been greatly improved!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the exciting interaction and role-development experience in Monkey King Simulator Special Edition.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >   </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >If you find bugs or have any suggestion, feel free to contact me. You can send an email or leave me a message on bilibili.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Good Luck &amp; Have Fun!</h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PRESENTS</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ShiNingCloud Studio</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an ARPG game developped by Unreal Engine 5.5 and features the  Sparring &amp; Suppression combat experience. In this game,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can  experience intense BOSS combats<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686170/extras/88b10c2043e67642fc12f25d26473069.poster.avif?t=1750956349\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686170/extras/88b10c2043e67642fc12f25d26473069.webm?t=1750956349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686170/extras/88b10c2043e67642fc12f25d26473069.mp4?t=1750956349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Also Hack&amp;Slash Minion wipes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686170/extras/1c7c67518f7604ed268f472e7481e4c7.poster.avif?t=1750956349\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686170/extras/1c7c67518f7604ed268f472e7481e4c7.webp?t=1750956349\" class=\"bb_img\" data-has-big width=800 height=340 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Unique Suppress-OVERTAKE system</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Gives you an unique interaction experience.(Similar to Sekiro's offset, but it's focused on attack instead of defense)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >An 3D Diablo-like Loot game behind the cool actions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Except super cool actions, this game also has a Diablo-like role development, loot system and 3 totally different\u00a0skill trees. Allocate your attributes, skill points FREELY and BUILD your own battle style! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 3 difficulties(Human, Asura, Celestial) in game. Higher the difficulty, better the drops! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conquer your enemy\u00a0and  LOOT your reward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Fully Upgraded with UE5 on &quot;Very Positive&quot; previous work</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Based on my first UE4 game &quot;Monkey King Simulator - Huaguo Mountain&quot;, this game has been fully rebuilt, polished and upgraded with Unreal Engine 5. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Action, Gameplay and End-game content  have been greatly improved!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the exciting interaction and role-development experience in Monkey King Simulator Special Edition.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >   </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >If you find bugs or have any suggestion, feel free to contact me. You can send an email or leave me a message on bilibili.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Good Luck &amp; Have Fun!</h2>",
    "short_description": "This is an ARPG game features the Sparring &amp; Suppression combat. The Suppress-OVERTAKE system will give you an unique interaction experience! Except super cool actions, it also has a Diablo-like skill tree &amp; loot system which you can build your own battle style.",
